{"type":"message_update","usage":{"input":8838,"output":1267,"cacheRead":49280,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":302,"totalTokens":59385,"cost":{"input":0.0013257,"output":0.0006335,"cacheRead":0.0014784,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0034376}},"assistantMessageEvent":{"type":"thinking_end","contentIndex":0,"content":"Interesting: 16 entries, one missing from provenance list... Count shown: ah, bd, dont, dulce-de-leche, espectacular, funkalization, genesis, incitaciones, openspec, pretender, specodelic, testaruda, turu, vampiro, wai, wild = 16. ✓\n\nThe UNDOCUMENTED rows like \"dont forget\", \"dont color\", \"turu help\" — likely genuine undocumented flags/subcommands, or `--help`/`-V` noise. E.g., \"help\" is auto-generated clap flag/subcommand; many tools' --help lists `--help`/`-V` which I skip as flags only for long flags... wait \"help\" for ah came from a \"Commands:\" section (clap lists `help  Print this message`). That's noise-ish but general. Not tuning per anti-goal.\n\nNote: espectacular/genesis/funkalization/dulce-de-leche binaries absent → those tools produced no rows. turu binary name mismatch handled (turu in whisper repo, binary=turu found? provenance says extracted ✓).\n\nNow write the research artifact per brief's follow-up threshold. Then commit, run gates (cargo test, just tier0), dogfood check, check off tasks 2.1–2.5, final commit.\n\nWhere do research artifacts live? .wai/projects/evallerina/research/YYYY-MM-DD-*.md."}}
